<title>USA: Omaha hogs average price/weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs average price/weights - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>Omaha, NE	Monday, August 04, 1997     USDA Market News</p>
<p>Omaha Hog Average cost and weight for Fri, Aug 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts:</p>
<p>  247 lbs  57.35   Year ago:   269 lbs  61.68</p>
<p>All hogs:</p>
<p>  269 lbs  55.59   Year ago:   324 lbs  56.54</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
